  "rawText": "(> JESSE ABEL FRANCIS\n\n. PERSONAL\n\n>\n\n1. Eighthh child in the family of James H. and Pearl C. Francis\n\n2. Born January 27, 1919.\n\n3: Married to Annie Inez Evans Francis who passed away on March 15, 1990 after 42 happy\nand memorable years together.\nI. EDUCATION\nis CompletedElementary Education at the Daniel Chapel Elementary; and graduated from\nEastman High School in Halifax County as Valedictorian of my class.\n2. Earned a Bachelor of Science Degree, as a self-help student from A. and T. State University\nin Agricultural Education and Biological Science and a Masters Degree in Vocational\nEducation.\n3. Earned a Professional Certification in Business Administration, and a certificate in Analytical\nChemistry from A and T. State University.\n4. Earned an Elementary and Secondary School Principal’s Certification in School |\n\nAdministration and Supervision at the East Carolina State University in Greensville, N.C.",
  "cleanedText": "(> JESSE ABEL FRANCIS\n\n. PERSONAL\n\n>\n\n1. Eighthh child in the family of James H. and Pearl C. Francis\n\n2. Born January 27, 1919.\n\n3: Married to Annie Inez Evans Francis who passed away on March 15, 1990 after 42 happy\nand memorable years together.\nI. EDUCATION\nis CompletedElementary Education at the Daniel Chapel Elementary; and graduated from\nEastman High School in Halifax County as Valedictorian of my class.\n2. Earned a Bachelor of Science Degree, as a self-help student from A. and T. State University\nin Agricultural Education and Biological Science and a Masters Degree in Vocational\nEducation.\n3. Earned a Professional Certification in Business Administration, and a certificate in Analytical\nChemistry from A and T. State University.\n4. Earned an Elementary and Secondary School Principal’s Certification in School I\n\nAdministration and Supervision at the East Carolina State University in Greensville, N.C.",
